{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents"]]},"topicSections":[{"title":"Initializers","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSLinearProgressIndicator\/init(progress:status:track:stopIndicator:helperText:gapSize:animated:)","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSLinearProgressIndicator\/init(status:track:helperText:helperTextAlignment:gapSize:)"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Initializers"},{"title":"Instance Properties","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSLinearProgressIndicator\/body"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Instance-Properties"},{"title":"Enumerations","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSLinearProgressIndicator\/HelperTextAlignment","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSLinearProgressIndicator\/HelperTextType"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Enumerations"},{"title":"Default Implementations","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSLinearProgressIndicator\/View-Implementations","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSLinearProgressIndicator\/View-Implementations"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Default-Implementations"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A linear indicator shows the progress of a task using a horizontal line."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"It can show a specific value (determinate) or just that something is in progress (indeterminate)."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Best used inside layouts to show progress."}],"sections":[],"relationshipsSections":[{"title":"Conforms To","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/s16SendableMetatypeP","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/7SwiftUI4ViewP"],"kind":"relationships","type":"conformsTo"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"@","kind":"attribute"},{"text":"MainActor","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM","kind":"attribute"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OUDSLinearProgressIndicator","kind":"identifier"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"]}]},{"mentions":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/Indicators"],"kind":"mentions"},{"content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Variants","anchor":"Variants","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Two variants are provided:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Determinate"}]},{"text":": the caller provides a ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"progress"},{"text":" value in ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"[0, 1]"},{"text":". Values outside this range are coerced.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Shows the exact progress of a task, usually as a percentage from 0% to 100%.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Provides clear and measurable feedback, helping users understand how long the task will take and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"reducing uncertainty.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Use determinate indicators whenever possible. Avoid indeterminate when progress can be measured, e.g.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"when the progress value is known (file upload, installation, data sync) or when the system can estimate","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"completion time or percentage.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Indeterminate"}]},{"text":": no ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"progress"},{"text":" is provided and the indicator loops continuously.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Shows that a process is active without indicating exact progress.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Used when the system cannot determine how long the task will take.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Communicates that the system is working, even without precise data, and prevents users from thinking","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the interface is frozen.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"For long loading times (over 5 seconds), additional context must be provided.","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","text":"Statuses","anchor":"Statuses","level":2},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Neutral"}]},{"text":": default status used when progress has no specific semantic meaning. Suitable for generic","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"loading, processing, synchronization or background tasks.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Accent"}]},{"text":": used to highlight primary or brand-related actions (uploads, downloads, installations,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"onboarding).","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Positive"}]},{"text":": indicates successful progress or a process leading to a successful outcome.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Info"}]},{"text":": indicates informational or system-related processes (background synchronization, data","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"retrieval).","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Warning"}]},{"text":": indicates progress related to an operation that requires user attention or should be","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"monitored.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Negative"}]},{"text":": indicates progress related to an error, recovery, cancellation or failure.","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","text":"Gap size","anchor":"Gap-size","level":2},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"default"}]},{"text":": standard gap between the bar and the track (base Android Material 3 specification).","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"small"}]},{"text":": reduced gap for a more compact appearance.","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","text":"Track","anchor":"Track","level":2},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"true"},{"text":" (default): the track is displayed. Recommended when the indicator is shown on its own and needs","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"a clear structure. The track helps define the full range of progress and makes the value easier to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"read.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"false"},{"text":": the track is hidden. Recommended when the indicator is embedded inside another component","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(button, tag, toast) or when a more minimal appearance is needed.","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","text":"Stop indicator (determinate only)","anchor":"Stop-indicator-determinate-only","level":2},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"false"},{"text":" (default): no stop indicator is drawn.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"true"},{"text":": a small square (or dot if the theme uses rounded caps) is drawn at the end of the track to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"identify the end of the range easily. Required by accessibility criteria when the track has a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"contrast below 3:1 with its container or the surface behind the container.","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The stop indicator is only available on the determinate variant, matching the Android Material 3","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"specification: the indeterminate variant has no meaningful end position for it.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"heading","text":"Helper text","anchor":"Helper-text","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"An optional text displayed below the progress bar to provide context or additional information.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"In ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"determinate"}]},{"text":" mode, use ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSLinearProgressIndicator\/HelperTextType","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" which offers two variants:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".description(_:)"}]},{"text":": Displays a simple description text without the progress percentage.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"The ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"alignment"},{"text":" parameter controls horizontal alignment (","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".center"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".start"},{"text":", or ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".end"},{"text":").","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".percent(description:alignment:)"}]},{"text":": Displays the progress percentage with an optional description.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"The percentage value and its ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"%"},{"text":" symbol are assembled through the localized wording key","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"core_progressIndicator_percent_value"},{"text":", so the symbol, its spacing and its position follow the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"typographic rules of the current language (e.g. ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\"75%\""},{"text":" in English, ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\"75 %\""},{"text":" in French, ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\"٪75\""},{"text":" in Arabic).","type":"text"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"alignment"},{"type":"text","text":" is "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".center"},{"type":"text","text":" (default), only the percentage is shown, centered."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"alignment"},{"type":"text","text":" is "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".start"},{"type":"text","text":", the percentage is at the leading edge and the description (if provided) at the trailing edge."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"alignment"},{"type":"text","text":" is "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".end"},{"type":"text","text":", the description (if provided) is at the leading edge and the percentage at the trailing edge."}]}]}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"In ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"indeterminate"}]},{"text":" mode, the ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"helperText"},{"text":" parameter is a simple ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"String?"},{"text":" with a separate ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"helperTextAlignment"},{"text":" parameter:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".center"}]},{"text":" (default): The text is centered under the progress bar.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".start"}]},{"text":": The text is aligned to the leading edge.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".end"}]},{"text":": The text is aligned to the trailing edge.","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","text":"Animation","anchor":"Animation","level":2},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Determinate"}]},{"text":": when ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"animated"},{"text":" is ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"true"},{"text":" (default), the indicator progressively fills from ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"0"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"to the target ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"progress"},{"text":" on first display and animates any subsequent change of ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"progress"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(based on Android Material 3 specifications). When ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"animated"},{"text":" is ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"false"},{"text":", the indicator is displayed instantly at its target value with no animation.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Indeterminate"}]},{"text":": the Android Material 3 two-line animation is intrinsic to the mode and cannot be disabled from the call site; there is no ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"animated"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"parameter on the indeterminate initializer.","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Animations are always disabled and a static bar filled at 70% is displayed when either","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"accessibilityReduceMotion"},{"text":" is ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"true"},{"text":" or Low Power Mode is enabled.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"heading","text":"Code samples","anchor":"Code-samples","level":2},{"type":"heading","text":"Determinate — Basic usage","anchor":"Determinate-Basic-usage","level":3},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["    \/\/ Determinate — default (neutral, with track, default gap, reveal animation)","    OUDSLinearProgressIndicator(progress: 0.75)","","    \/\/ Determinate with an accent status, no track and a helper text","    OUDSLinearProgressIndicator(progress: 0.5,","                                status: .accent,","                                track: false,","                                helperText: .description(\"Uploading…\"))","","    \/\/ Description aligned to the end","    OUDSLinearProgressIndicator(progress: 0.5, helperText: .description(\"Uploading...\", alignment: .end))","","    \/\/ Percentage centered (default)","    OUDSLinearProgressIndicator(progress: 0.75, helperText: .percent())","","    \/\/ Percentage with description at start (percentage leading, description trailing)","    OUDSLinearProgressIndicator(progress: 0.75,","                                helperText: .percent(description: \"of 100 MB\", alignment: .start))","","    \/\/ Indeterminate","    OUDSLinearProgressIndicator(status: .info)","    OUDSLinearProgressIndicator(status: .accent, helperText: \"Processing…\")","","    \/\/ Helper text aligned to the end","    OUDSLinearProgressIndicator(status: .info,","                                helperText: \"Loading data…\",","                                helperTextAlignment: .end)"]},{"type":"heading","text":"Accessibility considerations","anchor":"Accessibility-considerations","level":2},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"In ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"determinate"}]},{"text":" mode, the view exposes the current progress as an accessibility value (percentage)","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"so that Voice Over reads e.g. ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"“75 percent”"}]},{"text":", and is marked with the ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".updatesFrequently"},{"text":" trait so that","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"assistive technologies know the value is changing. If a ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"helperText"},{"text":" is provided, it is exposed as the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"accessibility label (Voice Over reads e.g. ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"“Uploading. 75 percent”"}]},{"text":").","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The indicator never captures ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Full Keyboard Access"}]},{"text":" focus, as no interaction is possible on a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"progress indicator. On iOS 17+ \/ macOS 14+ \/ visionOS 1+ \/ watchOS 10+ \/ tvOS 17+, this is enforced","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"via ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"accessibilityRespondsToUserInteraction(false)"},{"text":"; on earlier OS versions, the semantic","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".isStaticText"},{"text":" trait is used.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"In ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"indeterminate"}]},{"text":" mode without helper text, the view is hidden from Voice Over","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".accessibilityHidden(true)"},{"text":") — and therefore also excluded from Full Keyboard Access navigation:","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"there is no readable value to expose. When a ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"helperText"},{"text":" is provided, the helper text is exposed","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"as accessibility label so the user still understands the context.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Animations are disabled when ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"accessibilityReduceMotion"},{"text":" is ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"true"},{"text":" or when Low Power Mode is enabled.","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","text":"Colored surfaces","anchor":"Colored-surfaces","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"When placed on an ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSColoredSurface","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":", the indicator switches to a ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"monochrome"}]},{"text":" rendering, the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"status"},{"text":" is ignored.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"heading","text":"Design documentation","anchor":"Design-documentation","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"https:\/\/unified-design-system.orange.com","type":"reference","isActive":true}]},{"type":"heading","text":"Themes rendering","anchor":"Themes-rendering","level":2},{"type":"heading","text":"Orange","anchor":"Orange","level":3},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"component_progress_indicator_linear_Orange","type":"image"}]},{"type":"heading","text":"Orange Compact","anchor":"Orange-Compact","level":3},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"component_progress_indicator_linear_OrangeCompact","type":"image"}]},{"type":"heading","text":"Sosh","anchor":"Sosh","level":3},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"component_progress_indicator_linear_Sosh","type":"image"}]},{"type":"heading","text":"Wireframe","anchor":"Wireframe","level":3},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"component_progress_indicator_linear_Wireframe","type":"image"}]},{"style":"note","type":"aside","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"1.2.0 (Figma component design version)"}]}],"name":"Version"},{"style":"note","type":"aside","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"3.0.0"}]}],"name":"Since"}],"kind":"content"}],"metadata":{"symbolKind":"struct","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"OUDSLinearProgressIndicator","kind":"identifier"}],"modules":[{"name":"Components"}],"title":"OUDSLinearProgressIndicator","externalID":"s:14OUDSComponents27OUDSLinearProgressIndicatorV","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OUDSLinearProgressIndicator","kind":"identifier"}],"roleHeading":"Structure","platforms":[{"unavailable":false,"beta":false,"name":"iOS","introducedAt":"15.0","deprecated":false},{"unavailable":false,"beta":false,"name":"macOS","introducedAt":"13.0","deprecated":false},{"unavailable":false,"beta":false,"name":"tvOS","introducedAt":"16.0","deprecated":false},{"unavailable":false,"beta":false,"name":"visionOS","introducedAt":"1.0","deprecated":false},{"unavailable":false,"beta":false,"name":"watchOS","introducedAt":"11.0","deprecated":false}],"role